--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: vis::open
visibility: public
--- !node &Alpha
pub port: 1
--- !node &Beta
pub port: 2
# `pub connections` — the endpoints are readable from anywhere.
--- !edge &Shown
pub connections: [Alpha, Beta]
# A bare member is private and immutable (D4.12), so this edge's endpoints are
# readable only from inside the scope that wrote them. The edge itself is
# public and addressable; what it relates is not disclosed.
--- !edge &Hidden
connections: [Alpha, Beta]
